ests included.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"388c1b5e3ad0bbc04651e894b56f82e0209310fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/git/trees/388c1b5e3ad0bbc04651e894b56f82e0209310fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/git/commits/3bec4652e21f10508f205bacb88a32eaacf454e0","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/3bec4652e21f10508f205bacb88a32eaacf454e0","html_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/commit/3bec4652e21f10508f205bacb88a32eaacf454e0","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/3bec4652e21f10508f205bacb88a32eaacf454e0/comments","author":{"login":"Wenjix","id":5824166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjQxNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5824166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix","html_url":"https://github.com/Wenjix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"Wenjix","id":5824166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjQxNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5824166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix","html_url":"https://github.com/Wenjix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"b50f7e98019cea326efc5173f82cf67449a02563","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/b50f7e98019cea326efc5173f82cf67449a02563","html_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/commit/b50f7e98019cea326efc5173f82cf67449a02563"}]},{"sha":"73c9cd362a141b0184181edbd42e0fe8c59a5a4a","node_id":"C_kwDOT6cWbNoAKDczYzljZDM2MmExNDFiMDE4NDE4MWVkYmQ0MmUwZmU4YzU5YTVhNGE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Wenjix","email":"wenjiefu8@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-16T20:53:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"Wenjix","email":"wenjiefu8@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-16T20:53:26Z"},"message":"fold: fix Bm25 corruption on same-transaction retract+insert\n\nThe pending posting/doclen maps accumulated net deltas and wrote the net\nas if it were the absolute value: editing a document in one tx (exactly\nwhat KeyedStream::upsert emits) stored tf 2->3 as 1, deleted postings\nwhose tf shrank but stayed positive, and corrupted DOCLEN on nearly\nevery edit. Séance (PR #6) hit this and worked around it with separate\ntransactions; this fixes the root cause.\n\nFix: last-write-wins set semantics — the final push per (term, key)\ndecides between writing the document's true absolute value and deleting.\nStill zero reads of prior state (mass retraction stays read-free). New\ntest pins edited-vs-direct index equality across tf-grow, tf-shrink,\nterm-add/remove, and doclen-change cases.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a01d3228bc05d2c1f9232defdb16ba71e1ecb59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/git/trees/1a01d3228bc05d2c1f9232defdb16ba71e1ecb59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/git/commits/73c9cd362a141b0184181edbd42e0fe8c59a5a4a","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/73c9cd362a141b0184181edbd42e0fe8c59a5a4a","html_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/commit/73c9cd362a141b0184181edbd42e0fe8c59a5a4a","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/73c9cd362a141b0184181edbd42e0fe8c59a5a4a/comments","author":{"login":"Wenjix","id":5824166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjQxNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5824166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix","html_url":"https://github.com/Wenjix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"Wenjix","id":5824166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjQxNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5824166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix","html_url":"https://github.com/Wenjix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"3bec4652e21f10508f205bacb88a32eaacf454e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/3bec4652e21f10508f205bacb88a32eaacf454e0","html_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/commit/3bec4652e21f10508f205bacb88a32eaacf454e0"}]},{"sha":"b4ec73cf542757f072f8845322ab73589babace1","node_id":"C_kwDOT6cWbNoAKGI0ZWM3M2NmNTQyNzU3ZjA3MmY4ODQ1MzIyYWI3MzU4OWJhYmFjZTE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Wenjix","email":"wenjiefu8@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-16T20:53:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"Wenjix","email":"wenjiefu8@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-16T20:53:26Z"},"message":"fold: Meter operator — the pipeline narrating its own work\n\nA stateless tap (Meter::new(\"name\", inner)) that counts pushes,\ninserts, retracts, and net deltas flowing through it and times push and\ncommit below it, into a process-local MeterRegistry. Exists so an\napplication's incrementality claim can come from inside the dataflow —\nobserved deltas, not a stopwatch around wtx. ~200 lines, no allocation\non the hot path, no I/O.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6e797f35f734b19cc2e44b38d442781c5f608d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/git/trees/c6e797f35f734b19cc2e44b38d442781c5f608d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/git/commits/b4ec73cf542757f072f8845322ab73589babace1","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/b4ec73cf542757f072f8845322ab73589babace1","html_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/commit/b4ec73cf542757f072f8845322ab73589babace1","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/b4ec73cf542757f072f8845322ab73589babace1/comments","author":{"login":"Wenjix","id":5824166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjQxNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5824166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix","html_url":"https://github.com/Wenjix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"Wenjix","id":5824166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjQxNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5824166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix","html_url":"https://github.com/Wenjix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wenjix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"73c9cd362a141b0184181edbd42e0fe8c59a5a4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/73c9cd362a141b0184181edbd42e0fe8c59a5a4a","html_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/commit/73c9cd362a141b0184181edbd42e0fe8c59a5a4a"}]},{"sha":"72b1b53f1b271ba20aa27ccf0e85c6fdb1e2c1f5","node_id":"C_kwDOT6cWbNoAKDcyYjFiNTNmMWIyNzFiYTIwYWEyN2NjZjBlODVjNmZkYjFlMmMxZjU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Wenjix","email":"wenjiefu8@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-16T20:57:32Z"},"committer":{"name":"Wenjix","email":"wenjiefu8@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-16T20:57:32Z"},"message":"soundings: the instrument — editor, lenses, corrigendum, chips, authored lenses, gale\n\nA sentence-click editor on warm paper where every view is an\neagerly-maintained fold materialization: concrete↔abstract and length\nlens washes (Map -> Table scores), nearest-voice cards from a\n129k-sentence Gutenberg canon (Map(ese) -> Hnsw, graph-snapshot\nfast-load), the corrigendum retraction beat (struck-never-deleted, chit\nreceipt, bit-identical restore), gutter chips (edit µs + length\npercentile via a Histogram sink over the whole canon), runtime lens\nauthoring as (lens, sentence) keys with one-wtx backfill, and a gale\nreplay pitting the fold pipeline against a naive full-rescan arm running\nthe same scoring code, with a score-digest referee.\n\nTransport is examples/chat's blessed shape, tripled: ws -> mpsc -> one\ningest thread per stream (doc / canon / lens) -> watch -> ws. The HUD is\nMeter-narrated: delta counts and stage timings come from inside the\npipeline; the wall-clock stopwatch is lab